# Samosa

## Ingredients
Flour
Water
Oil
Potato
Salt
Chillies

## Instructions
1.Knead the flour, water and oil to make a dough
2.Boil the potatoes
3.Fry the boiled potatoes with salt and chillies
4.Roll the dough to create triangles
5.Fill the dough with potato stuffing
6.Deep fry in oil
7.Serve hot with favorite sauce!
